{"id": "3282b948-87fa-4565-8e32-5a8b1117aad9", "slug": "vanguard-distributed-teams-workspace", "title": "Vanguard - Distributed Teams Workspace", "description": "Vanguard Distributed Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Vanguard - Distributed Teams Workspace\"\ndescription: \"Vanguard Distributed Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#000000\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#000000\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Vanguard - Distributed Teams Workspace\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 2; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: login, animated, webgl, threejs, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nVanguard Distributed Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nVanguard Products Solutions Customers Pricing Resources Sign in Start Free Engineered for teams that scale globally Unify your workflows, automate global payroll, and keep your entire organization aligned — all from one…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Engineered for teams that scale globally.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #000000, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #000000, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Vanguard - Distributed Teams Workspace</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gray-100 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-10 font-['Inter'] antialiased selection:bg-cyan-100 selection:text-cyan-900\">\n\n    <!-- Main Application Card -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-6xl bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-[0_20px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] overflow-hidden min-h-[750px] flex flex-col border border-gray-100\">\n\n        <!-- Animated Background Canvas -->\n        <!-- Filter applied inline to soften the generated geometry into a frosted glass look -->\n        <canvas id=\"geometry-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"filter: blur(8px) saturate(1.2); opacity: 0.85; mix-blend-mode: multiply;\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Fade Overlay -->\n        <!-- Ensures the header and top content remain perfectly readable against the background -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-white/95 to-transparent h-[75%] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-6 sm:px-10\">\n            <!-- Brand -->\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-gray-900 group\" aria-label=\"Home\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-3-linear\" class=\"text-2xl transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:rotate-45\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-lg tracking-tight\">Vanguard</span>\n            </a>\n\n            <!-- Navigation Links -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-10\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Products</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Customers</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Resources</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Actions -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden sm:block text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Sign in</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-emerald-400 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\">\n                    Start Free\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow flex items-center justify-center text-center px-4 pt-10 pb-32\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col items-center\">\n                \n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase text-gray-900 leading-[1.1] mb-6\">\n                    Engineered for teams<br />that scale globally\n                </h1>\n                \n                <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-500 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n                    Unify your workflows, automate global payroll, and keep your entire organization aligned — all from one intelligent workspace.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- CTA Form -->\n                <form class=\"flex items-center w-full max-w-lg bg-white rounded-full p-1.5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 focus-within:ring-4 focus-within:ring-cyan-50 focus-within:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md\">\n                    <input \n                        type=\"email\" \n                        placeholder=\"Enter your email address\" \n                        aria-label=\"Email address\"\n                        class=\"flex-grow bg-transparent px-6 py-3 text-sm text-gray-700 placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none w-full\" \n                        required\n                    >\n                    <button \n                        type=\"submit\" \n                        class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white text-sm font-medium px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full hover:bg-black transition-colors whitespace-nowrap flex-shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\"\n                    >\n                        Create Workspace\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg opacity-70\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Background Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('geometry-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n\n        // Configuration for the procedural geometry\n        const blockSize = 64; \n        const padding = 2;   \n        const cornerRadius = 16;\n\n        function resizeCanvas() {\n            // High-DPI display support\n            const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n            const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n            \n            width = rect.width;\n            height = rect.height;\n            \n            canvas.width = width * dpr;\n            canvas.height = height * dpr;\n            \n            ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n        resizeCanvas();\n\n        let time = 0;\n\n        // Helper to draw rounded paths\n        function createRoundedRectPath(x, y, w, h, r) {\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(x + r, y);\n            ctx.lineTo(x + w - r, y);\n            ctx.arcTo(x + w, y, x + w, y + r, r);\n            ctx.lineTo(x + w, y + h - r);\n            ctx.arcTo(x + w, y + h, x + w - r, y + h, r);\n            ctx.lineTo(x + r, y + h);\n            ctx.arcTo(x, y + h, x, y + h - r, r);\n            ctx.lineTo(x, y + r);\n            ctx.arcTo(x, y, x + r, y, r);\n            ctx.closePath();\n        }\n\n        // Color interpolation function\n        function lerpRGB(color1, color2, factor) {\n            const result = color1.slice();\n            for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n                result[i] = Math.round(result[i] + factor * (color2[i] - color1[i]));\n            }\n            return result;\n        }\n\n        function renderFrame() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            time += 0.003; // Animation speed\n\n            const cols = Math.ceil(width / (blockSize + padding)) + 2;\n            const rows = Math.ceil(height / (blockSize + padding)) + 2;\n\n            // Palette based on the reference image\n            const paletteLeft = [56, 189, 248];   // Tailwind Sky 400\n            const paletteCenter = [52, 211, 153]; // Tailwind Emerald 400\n            const paletteRight = [250, 204, 21];  // Tailwind Yellow 400\n\n            for (let x = -1; x < cols; x++) {\n                for (let y = -1; y < rows; y++) {\n                    const px = x * (blockSize + padding);\n                    const py = y * (blockSize + padding);\n\n                    const nx = x / cols;\n                    const ny = y / rows;\n\n                    // Create a 'V' shaped void in the top center\n                    const centerX = 0.5;\n                    const centerY = -0.4; // Virtual center above canvas\n                    const distance = Math.sqrt(Math.pow(nx - centerX, 2) + Math.pow(ny - centerY, 2));\n\n                    // Base visibility\n                    let alpha = Math.max(0, (distance - 0.7) * 2.5);\n                    if (alpha > 1) alpha = 1;\n\n                    // Add procedural animation noise\n                    const waveX = Math.sin(nx * 8 + time * 1.5);\n                    const waveY = Math.cos(ny * 8 - time * 1.2);\n                    const noise = waveX * waveY * 0.15;\n                    \n                    alpha = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, alpha + noise));\n\n                    if (alpha > 0.05) {\n                        // Determine base color based on horizontal position\n                        let baseColor;\n                        if (nx < 0.5) {\n                            baseColor = lerpRGB(paletteLeft, paletteCenter, nx * 2);\n                        } else {\n                            baseColor = lerpRGB(paletteCenter, paletteRight, (nx - 0.5) * 2);\n                        }\n\n                        // Pulsing effect\n                        const pulse = (Math.sin(time * 4 + x * 0.3 + y * 0.2) + 1) * 0.5;\n                        const finalAlpha = alpha * (0.5 + pulse * 0.5);\n\n                        // Draw solid block\n                        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(${baseColor[0]}, ${baseColor[1]}, ${baseColor[2]}, ${finalAlpha})`;\n                        createRoundedRectPath(px, py, blockSize, blockSize, cornerRadius);\n                        ctx.fill();\n\n                        // Draw top bevel/highlight to simulate 3D volume\n                        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${finalAlpha * 0.6})`;\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.moveTo(px + cornerRadius, py);\n                        ctx.lineTo(px + blockSize - cornerRadius, py);\n                        ctx.arcTo(px + blockSize, py, px + blockSize, py + cornerRadius, cornerRadius);\n                        ctx.lineTo(px + blockSize, py + blockSize * 0.35);\n                        // Curving the highlight down\n                        ctx.bezierCurveTo(\n                            px + blockSize * 0.6, py + blockSize * 0.2, \n                            px + blockSize * 0.1, py + blockSize * 0.5, \n                            px, py + cornerRadius\n                        );\n                        ctx.arcTo(px, py, px + cornerRadius, py, cornerRadius);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                        \n                        // Subtle inner shadow/darkening on the bottom\n                        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(0, 0, 0, ${finalAlpha * 0.15})`;\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.moveTo(px + cornerRadius, py + blockSize);\n                        ctx.lineTo(px + blockSize - cornerRadius, py + blockSize);\n                        ctx.arcTo(px + blockSize, py + blockSize, px + blockSize, py + blockSize - cornerRadius, cornerRadius);\n                        ctx.lineTo(px + blockSize, py + blockSize * 0.6);\n                        ctx.bezierCurveTo(\n                            px + blockSize * 0.5, py + blockSize * 0.8, \n                            px, py + blockSize * 0.5, \n                            px, py + blockSize - cornerRadius\n                        );\n                        ctx.arcTo(px, py + blockSize, px + cornerRadius, py + blockSize, cornerRadius);\n                        ctx.fill();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(renderFrame);\n        }\n\n        // Initialize animation\n        renderFrame();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "vanguard-distributed-teams-workspace.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/vanguard-distributed-teams-workspace.jpg", "source_name": "vanguard-distributed-teams-workspace-DESIGN.md", "views": 46, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T07:27:54.07885+00:00"}